Project IGI Mod Base — IGI 1 MVP

This repository does not distribute Project I.G.I. executables, game assets,
or other proprietary game content.

Research attribution:
- Neonix Modding Team / IGI-RE (GPL-2.0-only) supplies the catalogued native
  addresses/names and signature metadata in `data/IGI1/`. No IGI-RE function
  implementation source is included in this MVP.
- heaven-hm/project-igi-natives (MIT) is the planned migration predecessor.
  Its historical design informed this SDK, but its source is not bundled in
  this repository.

Future integrations of Dear ImGui, MinHook, GTLibCpp, or other dependencies
must add the exact upstream version and license text before shipping code.
